                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "01435242-0098-35ea-8387-32fb144805ca",
                        "entry_id": "a78103ff-134a-31ef-9a9d-1c540498abf3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. шум, грохот"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "caef4d0f-bf73-4cf2-a20a-4a3325ff1243",
                                "sense_id": "01435242-0098-35ea-8387-32fb144805ca",
                                "text": "Кузов машины заставлен бочками и бачками, гремящими и подпрыгивающими, устраивающими буйный тарарам."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "604c6f60-39b1-339a-85ed-024980caf59f",
                        "entry_id": "a78103ff-134a-31ef-9a9d-1c540498abf3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. переполох, суматоха, беспорядок"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fdcb2dab-b3ae-378e-b747-3112261ad3e1",
                        "entry_id": "a78103ff-134a-31ef-9a9d-1c540498abf3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. скандал"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "39d978e9-6660-473d-9138-f67043054a9d",
                                "sense_id": "fdcb2dab-b3ae-378e-b747-3112261ad3e1",
                                "text": "Вдобавок у вас только восемь дней перебор, и то вы поднимаете тарарам."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "102d97d2-279b-32c3-9e14-8dca70e6172b",
                        "entry_id": "a78103ff-134a-31ef-9a9d-1c540498abf3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. шумное, беспорядочное веселье, кутёж"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a86e9f5-f8bf-46ed-87a2-d11b94683fa7",
                                "sense_id": "102d97d2-279b-32c3-9e14-8dca70e6172b",
                                "text": "Почему-то всплывает в памяти сцена: шум, тарарам, льётся рекой алкоголь, мы танцуем с хозяйкой, её полные обнажённые руки лежат на моей шее, а пальцы щекочут затылок, мимо плывут стены, увешанные расписанными под лубок деревянными кухонными досками, на каких режут салаты, какая-то медная деревенская посуда..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1668b1cc-e12b-4a49-b71b-a17bd105d179",
                        "source_entry_id": "a78103ff-134a-31ef-9a9d-1c540498abf3",
                        "source_sense_description": "шум, грохот",
                        "target_lang_word": "hullaballoo",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hullaballoo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd748cfe-e7a6-3b70-b031-819a4cd5c851",
                                        "entry_id": "9fc0be5b-f7dd-3e5b-a583-a85984b2ad3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of hullabaloo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cae6966a-8528-4913-bf8d-0a3bede005b2",
                                                "sense_id": "fd748cfe-e7a6-3b70-b031-819a4cd5c851",
                                                "text": "[…]The truth of all this hullaballoo was that Rigby had a sly pension which, by an inevitable association of ideas, he always connected with the maintenance of an Aristocracy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ab6ffe3-d650-4674-841c-7ba23f71368e",
                                                "sense_id": "fd748cfe-e7a6-3b70-b031-819a4cd5c851",
                                                "text": "'Sarah, could you bring me the calendar from the wall over there? Does it say the right date?' 'Two days behind – and small wonder no one tore it off with all the hullaballoo going on. Ever so pretty, isn't it?' said Sarah as she handed the calendar to Jessamy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hullaballoo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34474555-a8cb-303f-9241-a60ec533c257",
                                        "entry_id": "73cbd9d3-2747-3f96-bf14-7e4d04f30c01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of hullabaloo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "354d174c-0ea1-4a5f-815f-406491c05960",
                                                "sense_id": "34474555-a8cb-303f-9241-a60ec533c257",
                                                "text": "They roared, they danced, they hullaballoed, they pinched one another; they behaved like young savages – but I knew I had got them safe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3332533d-4095-4254-a29c-491f76f631d2",
                                                "sense_id": "34474555-a8cb-303f-9241-a60ec533c257",
                                                "text": "\"Nonsense, child,\" said my father, smiling. \"Did you ever see a stone thrown into the pond? there's a great splash, and a few circles on the water, and that's about all, isn't it? Well, when I die there'll be a great splash of tears and hullaballooing, and a few circles of tender recollections, and then the surface will smooth itself over, and it'll be all right again.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2449159-b5d4-467b-b542-906cd0581c95",
                                                "sense_id": "34474555-a8cb-303f-9241-a60ec533c257",
                                                "text": "Ho, hullaballoing clan / Agape, with woe / In your beaks, on the gabbing capes!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c07acaa-549b-4ab4-8c14-df816f7bb184",
                                                "sense_id": "34474555-a8cb-303f-9241-a60ec533c257",
                                                "text": "Twitter broke the news, and soon enough, the media hullaballooed over this latest act of art vandalism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c207fbd-876b-4a8b-a479-4a287e72ce37",
                                                "sense_id": "34474555-a8cb-303f-9241-a60ec533c257",
                                                "text": "In addition to size, manufacturers hope to attract buyers with added gadgetry despite disappointing sales of 3D televisions, an innovation hullaballooed at CES last year only to flop in stores."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
